Two customers buy the last unit at the same moment, on Postgres's default isolation level. What can happen?

```ts
const p = await db.one('SELECT stock FROM products WHERE id = $1', [id])
if (p.stock < qty) throw new OutOfStock()
await db.none('UPDATE products SET stock = $1 WHERE id = $2', [p.stock - qty, id])
```

